BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:100th Annual Graham County Fair
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTSTAMP:20261011T134211Z
UID:21b99466e6d5d383414a3490@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:From thrilling rides and hometown parades to sizzling fair foo
 d and spotlight entertainment\, the fair is where the Gila Valley gathers 
 to celebrate our roots\, our people\, and our spirit. Our 99th year is all
  about feeling fine and celebrating what makes our community one-of-a-kind
 . Whether you're a longtime fairgoer\, a curious first-timer\, or visiting
  Arizona for the season — come see what’s new\, what’s nostalgic\, a
 nd what makes this our most anticipated event of the year.\n\nEvent websit
 e: https://www.grahamcountyfair.com/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www
 .visitarizona.com/events/100th-annual-graham-county-fair
LAST-MODIFIED:20261011T134211Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/100th-annual-graham-county-fair
END:VEVENT
